[TITLE]
CRASH-31: a run of 1,000,000 hours in 100,000-hour steps, with a status report

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID   Elev  Demand
 J1   100   10

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID   Head
 R1   150

[PIPES]
;ID  N1  N2  Length  Diam  Rough
 P1  R1  J1  1000    12    100

[TIMES]
 Duration            1000000    ; hours: "1000000:00:00" is 13 characters
 Hydraulic Timestep  100000     ; large steps keep the run to 11 periods
 Pattern Timestep    100000
 Report Timestep     100000

[REPORT]
 Status   Yes                   ; writes a clock time for every period

[OPTIONS]
 Units      GPM
 Headloss   H-W

[END]
